{"tid":1304,"title":"How to get your steam ID with pictures!","fid":21,"partial":true,"preserved":10,"expected":21,"last_date":"2009-08-24T10:40:00","crumbs":[{"name":"General","fid":3},{"name":"Help & Support","fid":21}],"users":{"gazzy15":{"name":"gazzy15","color":"green","bold":false,"strike":false,"title":"Senior Member","joined":"Feb 2009","posts":669,"avatar":null},"Vautaut":{"name":"Vautaut","color":"purple","bold":false,"strike":false,"title":"Super Donator","joined":"Dec 2008","posts":242,"avatar":null},"Cyber Muffin":{"name":"Cyber Muffin","color":"green","bold":false,"strike":false,"title":"Donator","joined":"May 2009","posts":390,"avatar":null},"Alexander":{"name":"Alexander","color":"green","bold":false,"strike":false,"title":"Donator","joined":"Apr 2009","posts":244,"avatar":null},"Clown":{"name":"Clown","color":"black","bold":true,"strike":false,"title":"'Live life, have fun.'","joined":"Nov 2008","posts":2573,"avatar":null},"Drewley":{"name":"Drewley","color":"black","bold":true,"strike":false,"title":"Super Administrator","joined":"Nov 2008","posts":198,"avatar":"1779.png"},"Mr.Hotrod":{"name":"Mr.Hotrod","color":"red","bold":true,"strike":false,"title":"Server Admin","joined":"Jun 2009","posts":213,"avatar":null},"Matais":{"name":"Matais","color":"purple","bold":false,"strike":false,"title":"Server Admin","joined":"Mar 2009","posts":500,"avatar":null}},"posts":[{"pid":14923,"num":1,"date":"2009-06-10T09:30:00","author":"gazzy15","usertitle":"Senior Member","joined":"Feb 2009","author_posts":669,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFirst off your steam id is a unique id that's assigned to EVERYONE that owns a source game it's a rather good way to ban people because unlike your name and other details it cannot be changed!<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n2. Double click on garrys mod or another source engine game and press the console button it could be the one next to 1, if the console does not come up go to options then the keyboard tab, click advanced options then click the box next to enable developers console.<br/>\n<br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://img229.imageshack.us/img229/9058/68464021.png\"/><br/>\n<br/>\n3. Then create a mulitiplayer game. (Do i really need a SS for this bit?)<br/>\n<br/>\n4. Wait?<br/>\n<br/>\n5. When in the game click the console button(if you do not know just press buttons from top to bottom).<br/>\n<br/>\n6. You got your console up hooray, then type in status you should notice that some writing has come up this information contains how many people are on the server there steam name and steam ID <br/>\n<br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://img229.imageshack.us/img229/7973/status.png\"/><br/>\n<br/>\n7. You can now use Your steam ID for donating or whatever.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":"<div><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://i40.tinypic.com/2irub9e.png\"/><br/>\n<b>Specs:</b><br/>\n<b>CPU:</b> Intel i5 OC'd @ 3Ghz (Idles @ 1GHz for power reasons)<br/>\n<b>OS: </b>Win 7 64Bit<br/>\n<b>Mobo:</b> Asus P7P55D<br/>\n<b>GFX:</b> ATI 5770 1GB Crossfire'd<br/>\n<b>RAM:</b> 4GB DDR3 @ 667Mhz</div>"},{"pid":14924,"num":2,"date":"2009-06-10T09:57:00","author":"Vautaut","usertitle":"Super Donator","joined":"Dec 2008","author_posts":160,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWell.... this is quite a sexyful guide.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":""},{"pid":14926,"num":3,"date":"2009-06-10T10:00:00","author":"Cyber Muffin","usertitle":"Donator","joined":"May 2009","author_posts":243,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tI have done this all the time the hard way... To the launch options -console.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":""},{"pid":14927,"num":4,"date":"2009-06-10T10:05:00","author":"Alexander","usertitle":"Donator","joined":"Apr 2009","author_posts":202,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSome people can't open the console from in the game, including me. Probably because we don't have English keyboards. If this applies to you then do this:<br/>\n<br/>\nOpen your games list in steam, right click on Garry's Mod and click Properties.<br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://hem.bredband.net/alexander12/1.JPG\"/><br/>\n<br/>\nOnce inside properties click the button named Set launch options.<br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://hem.bredband.net/alexander12/2.JPG\"/><br/>\n<br/>\nA box will open up, write -console in it.<br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://hem.bredband.net/alexander12/3.JPG\"/><br/>\n<br/>\nPress OK, launch the game and you should have the console in the menu (or if you press escape while in a game).\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":"<div>Alexander Godis</div>"},{"pid":14931,"num":5,"date":"2009-06-10T11:45:00","author":"Clown","usertitle":"'Live life, have fun.'","joined":"Nov 2008","author_posts":1905,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tgreat guide...if you resize the pictures I will make this thread a sticky <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"inlineimg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"archive/assets/new/images/smilies/smile.png\" title=\"Smile\"/> (talking to gazzy, alexanders are fine)\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":"<div><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"archive/assets/shared/posts/4455f842d80d3dce.jpg\"/><br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://i28.tinypic.com/25qyvyb.jpg\"/></div>"},{"pid":14948,"num":6,"date":"2009-06-10T13:24:00","author":"gazzy15","usertitle":"Senior Member","joined":"Feb 2009","author_posts":669,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUpated first post with rezised pictures though the first one does not fit but is easily understandable <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"inlineimg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"archive/assets/new/images/smilies/smile.png\" title=\"Smile\"/>\n</blockquote>","sig":"<div><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://i40.tinypic.com/2irub9e.png\"/><br/>\n<b>Specs:</b><br/>\n<b>CPU:</b> Intel i5 OC'd @ 3Ghz (Idles @ 1GHz for power reasons)<br/>\n<b>OS: </b>Win 7 64Bit<br/>\n<b>Mobo:</b> Asus P7P55D<br/>\n<b>GFX:</b> ATI 5770 1GB Crossfire'd<br/>\n<b>RAM:</b> 4GB DDR3 @ 667Mhz</div>"},{"pid":15021,"num":7,"date":"2009-06-10T20:36:00","author":"Drewley","usertitle":"Super Administrator","joined":"Nov 2008","author_posts":198,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t~Stickied\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":""},{"pid":27665,"num":8,"date":"2009-08-24T06:50:00","author":"Mr.Hotrod","usertitle":"Server Admin","joined":"Jun 2009","author_posts":200,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tI added another way... <br/>\n<br/>\nStep 1: Login to steamcommunity.com <br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://i281.photobucket.com/albums/kk217/Hotrodx199/1.jpg\"/><br/>\n<br/>\nStep 2: Highlight and copy your profile id. This can be found by clicking \"view my profile\" or just by going to your control panel. If you have a custom URL with a custom ID that might say something like \"superhotvent\" or \"themob\" then high light that. <br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://i281.photobucket.com/albums/kk217/Hotrodx199/2.jpg\"/><br/>\n<br/>\nStep 3: Go to steamcalculator.com and paste your steam id. <br/>\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://i281.photobucket.com/albums/kk217/Hotrodx199/3.jpg\"/><br/>\n<br/>\nStep 4: Press go. If your name is correct copy the steam id and use it on whatever you want. <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://i281.photobucket.com/albums/kk217/Hotrodx199/4.jpg\"/><br/>\n<br/>\nCheers <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"inlineimg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"archive/assets/new/images/smilies/wink.png\" title=\"Wink\"/>\n</blockquote>","sig":"<div>♣♣♣♣♣♣♣♣♣♣♣<br/>\r\n||VM|| Hotrod <br/>\r\n♣♣♣♣♣♣♣♣♣♣♣</div>"},{"pid":27675,"num":9,"date":"2009-08-24T10:24:00","author":"Matais","usertitle":"Server Admin","joined":"Mar 2009","author_posts":404,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\n<div class=\"bbcode_container\">\n<div class=\"bbcode_quote\">\n<div class=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"bbcode_quote_container\"></div>\n<div class=\"bbcode_postedby\">\nQuote Originally Posted by <strong>gazzy15 </strong>\n</div>\n<div><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://img229.imageshack.us/img229/9058/68464021.png\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> what about crosshair color and size?\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":""},{"pid":27678,"num":10,"date":"2009-08-24T10:40:00","author":"gazzy15","usertitle":"Senior Member","joined":"Feb 2009","author_posts":669,"title":null,"edited":null,"html":"<blockquote>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tI was setting resoultion\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>","sig":"<div><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20100622045325im_/http://i40.tinypic.com/2irub9e.png\"/><br/>\n<b>Specs:</b><br/>\n<b>CPU:</b> Intel i5 OC'd @ 3Ghz (Idles @ 1GHz for power reasons)<br/>\n<b>OS: </b>Win 7 64Bit<br/>\n<b>Mobo:</b> Asus P7P55D<br/>\n<b>GFX:</b> ATI 5770 1GB Crossfire'd<br/>\n<b>RAM:</b> 4GB DDR3 @ 667Mhz</div>"}]}